https://shader-tutorial.dev/advanced/color-banding-dithering/\r\n\r\nI implemented this as an option: the users will be able to disable it if they want and tweak the dithering intensity.\r\n\r\n### Why didn't I implement this as a plugin?\r\n\r\nMy first thought was that it could be an extension of the `Gradient` class. However, I needed to make changes to the `get_color_at_offset` of the `Gradient` class by either overriding it in a child class or changing it's implementation directly.\r\nSince the method isn't virtual, creating a child class wasn't an option, excluding the possibility of implementing the dithering effect in a plugin.\r\n\r\n- _Bugsquad edit: closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12295_","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-22T20:43:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T09:46:07Z","closed_at":"2025-04-23T07:14:04Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ec802879bf1da6aa7113ba7f88e64c1ede0b2e37","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Astral-Sheep:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":529603955,"node_id":"R_kgDOH5Edcw","name":"godot","full_name":"Astral-Sheep/godot","owner":{"login":"Astral-Sheep","id":109028693,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn-lVQ","avatar_url":"https://a